<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore expects 5-7 pct growth in trade in 1997.</title>
<headline>Singapore expects 5-7 pct growth in trade in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's total trade growth for 1997 is expected to be between five to seven percent, the Trade Development Board said on Monday.</p>
<p>The board said in a statement that the growth would probably be closer to the upper end of the range.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
